# Both build contexts are basketwatch/, so BuildKit reads THIS file.
# It is load-bearing: without it `COPY . .` drags the host's node_modules into
# the image, and pnpm's symlink farm holds absolute paths into /Users/... that
# do not exist in the container. The failure is an ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND deep in
# a build with no obvious cause.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.turbo
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
